Easy Rollbacks
Deployed a bug? Roll back to previous version with one command.

Load Balancing
Built-in load balancing distributes traffic across all healthy Pods automatically.

Resource Optimization
Kubernetes efficiently packs containers onto nodes, maximizing resource usage.

